      "text": "Model request-based billing in us-central1 with no idle instances.\n1 vCPU, 512 MiB and 0.2 billed seconds per request.",
      "originalText": "Model request-based billing in us-central1 with no idle instances.\n1 vCPU, 512 MiB and 0.2 billed seconds per request.",
